1
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:36,060
What a beautiful stone.

2
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,100
Leaving something so important

3
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,660
in such an obvious place.

4
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,330
Is it a trap?

5
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:50,090
It's so hot!

6
00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:10,430
I set a trap to test her,

7
00:01:11,330 --> 00:01:14,930
but she'd rather burn herself
than destroy the spiritual stone.

8
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:29,890
It doesn't hurt anymore. Thank you, sir.

9
00:01:30,130 --> 00:01:31,030
But sir,

10
00:01:31,130 --> 00:01:33,700
you shouldn't leave that stone
lying around.

11
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:35,229
It can easily burn someone.

12
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:40,830
That was just an illusion I created.

13
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,100
It won't burn you.

14
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:52,660
An illusion?

15
00:01:53,259 --> 00:01:56,200
But his expression just now
didn't seem fake.

16
00:01:57,630 --> 00:01:58,830
He's testing me,

17
00:01:58,830 --> 00:01:59,930
yet saving me.

18
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:02,000
What does he want from me?

19
00:02:02,330 --> 00:02:06,030
Or is he trying to confirm what I'm not?

20
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,400
I have to figure this out.

21
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,630
About him, about myself,

22
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:11,830
about all of this.

23
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:19,460
Sect Leader,

24
00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:20,530
I've looked into it.

25
00:02:20,530 --> 00:02:22,829
That girl did indeed appear suddenly
in the cold pool.

26
00:02:22,829 --> 00:02:24,500
There's no demonic aura
for a hundred miles,

27
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:27,060
and no missing persons reported
in nearby mortal villages.

28
00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:28,130
It's like she appeared

29
00:02:28,130 --> 00:02:29,230
out of thin air.

30
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:31,060
Out of thin air?

31
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:33,329
A few months ago,

32
00:02:33,329 --> 00:02:35,000
the Eye of Gods and Demons was opened,

33
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,400
and something fell from the Void Illusion.

34
00:02:37,530 --> 00:02:38,860
Someone from the sky.

35
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:40,260
Could it be her?

36
00:02:44,329 --> 00:02:45,130
Sect Leader,

37
00:02:45,630 --> 00:02:49,200
you seem to care a lot about that girl.

38
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:51,900
More than care.

39
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:54,160
You even let her stay in your room.

40
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:57,100
No one but His Highness Bai
has had that privilege.

41
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,260
Ye Qifeng,

42
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,930
you have too much free time lately.

43
00:03:04,930 --> 00:03:05,730
Not at all!

44
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:08,030
I'll go find more clues right away.

45
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,830
By the way, Sect Leader,

46
00:03:12,830 --> 00:03:14,030
there's one more thing.

47
00:03:14,030 --> 00:03:15,660
Although the divine beast has been calmed,

48
00:03:15,660 --> 00:03:16,730
I found traces

49
00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:19,130
of demonic corruption on its seal.

50
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:25,160
It happened around the time
the divine beast awakened last night.

51
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:28,000
The time of that girl's appearance
perfectly coincides with the time the seal

52
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,600
was corrupted.

53
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:34,829
The Demonic Cult has already
infiltrated the Yan Sect.

54
00:03:34,829 --> 00:03:35,730
Or is she

55
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:38,060
really a spy?

56
00:03:51,130 --> 00:03:51,930
Feng,

57
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:54,660
keep investigating that girl's identity.

58
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:55,660
Yes.

59
00:04:00,930 --> 00:04:02,330
Sect Leader, bad news!

60
00:04:02,330 --> 00:04:04,400
A Demonic Cult spy sneaked in
and injured His Highness Bai.

61
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,600
The girl you locked up has also escaped.

62
00:04:07,730 --> 00:04:09,660
Everyone, go find her immediately!

63
00:04:09,660 --> 00:04:10,530
Catch her

64
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:19,000
and throw her in the dungeon.

65
00:04:20,730 --> 00:04:21,160
Get in!

66
00:04:26,130 --> 00:04:27,330
Why did you arrest me?

67
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:29,330
Let me out!

68
00:04:29,660 --> 00:04:31,130
Qi Zhezhi, I'm going to kill you!

69
00:04:31,130 --> 00:04:32,130
Keep quiet!

70
00:04:48,860 --> 00:04:50,130
Sister, I'm back.

71
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:52,460
Bai, can you take me out for a walk?

72
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:54,630
No problem. Let's go.

73
00:04:57,060 --> 00:04:58,000
Slow down.

74
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,600
No!

75
00:05:37,260 --> 00:05:39,530
Bai, wake up!

76
00:05:42,530 --> 00:05:44,830
Hold on. I'll go find some herbs for you.
